Z||000003||mbramble||04-24-2001||08:51 AM||||Yep, "or ebay".<P>I just picked up an 85 service manual for $37.  Looks to be in excellent shape.  Should arrive here soon.  I have seen them sell for over $100 on ebay but I have been watching for quite awhile to see if I could pick one up more cheaply.  It's amazing -- one shows up and everyone on the planet bids and drives the price sky high.  Two days later the same item shows up and 4 people bid on it.  Can't figure it out but I look for those items that are in the cycle with no one bidding.  Few and far between but sometimes ya get lucky.<P>Or just bite the bullet and order one from Helms.  I was just about to do that when I saw this one show up on ebay and no one bid on it for a couple days....<BR><p>[This message has been edited by mbramble (edited 04-24-2001).]||||reg||1
